<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>About Us — RoomHive</title>

        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/about.css') }}">

        <script>
            try {
                if (localStorage.getItem("rhTheme") === "dark") {
                    document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme-preview", "1");
                }
            } catch (e) {}
        </script>
        <script>
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>
    </head>

    <body>

        {% include 'partials/navbar.html.twig' with { current_page: '/about-us' } %}

        <main class="ab-page">
            <div class="ab-wrap">

                <section class="ab-hero ab-reveal" style="--d: .05s;">
                    <span class="ab-hero-badge">
                        <span class="ab-pulse-dot" style="width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--ab-honey);border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;"></span>
                        About RoomHive
                    </span>
                    <h1>Find. Stay.<br><span class="ab-accent">Feel at Home.</span></h1>
                    <p class="ab-lead">
                        RoomHive is a homegrown rental platform built for Negros
                        Oriental — connecting students, professionals, and families
                        with rooms, apartments, and houses they can trust.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="ab-section ab-reveal" style="--d: .12s;">
                    <div class="ab-section-head">
                        <span class="ab-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
                        <h2 class="ab-section-title">Built here, for here</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ab-story-grid">
                        <div class="ab-story-card">
                            <h3>The problem we kept seeing</h3>
                            <p>
                                Finding a place in Negros Oriental meant rented
                                sight-unseen deals, photos that never matched reality,
                                surprise charges, and listings that were long gone by
                                the time you called. Renters deserved better — and so
                                did the honest landlords doing things right.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ab-story-card">
                            <h3>Why a hive?</h3>
                            <p>
                                A hive works because every cell has a purpose and
                                everything is built together. That's how we treat
                                renting: every listing is hand-reviewed before it goes
                                live, every payment is protected, and every host and
                                tenant plays by the same clear rules. No agents. No
                                guesswork. Just a place to call home.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="ab-section ab-reveal" style="--d: .18s;">
                    <div class="ab-section-head">
                        <span class="ab-eyebrow">What We Stand For</span>
                        <h2 class="ab-section-title">Simple, safe, and honest</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ab-values-grid">
                        <div class="ab-value-card">
                            <span class="ab-value-icon"><i data-lucide="badge-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h4>Every listing hand-reviewed</h4>
                            <p>Our team checks each listing before it goes live. What you see on the page is what you'll find at the door.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ab-value-card">
                            <span class="ab-value-icon"><i data-lucide="shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h4>Secure reservations</h4>
                            <p>Booking a space means a protected 50% reserve held through RoomHive — never handed over blind.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ab-value-card">
                            <span class="ab-value-icon"><i data-lucide="receipt-text" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h4>No hidden fees</h4>
                            <p>The rate on the listing is the rate you pay. If a cancellation ever applies, it's written down first.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ab-value-card">
                            <span class="ab-value-icon"><i data-lucide="headset" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h4>Support around the clock</h4>
                            <p>Questions at noon or midnight — our team is on call for hosts and tenants, every day of the week.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="ab-section ab-reveal" style="--d: .24s;">
                    <div class="ab-section-head">
                        <span class="ab-eyebrow">How It Works</span>
                        <h2 class="ab-section-title">Three steps to move-in day</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ab-steps">
                        <div class="ab-step">
                            <span class="ab-step-icon"><i data-lucide="search" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h4>Browse real listings</h4>
                            <p>Filter by location, price, and amenities. Every photo, rate, and detail has already been reviewed by our team.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ab-step">
                            <span class="ab-step-icon"><i data-lucide="hand-coins" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h4>Reserve with 50%</h4>
                            <p>Send your request and secure the space with a half payment. The host signs your official receipt to confirm.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ab-step">
                            <span class="ab-step-icon"><i data-lucide="key-round" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h4>Move in</h4>
                            <p>Pay the balance at move-in and settle in. Your booking, receipts, and stay details live in your account.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="ab-section ab-reveal" style="--d: .3s;">
                    <div class="ab-host-band">
                        <div class="ab-host-copy">
                            <span class="ab-eyebrow">For Property Owners</span>
                            <h3>Your empty space could be someone's home</h3>
                            <p>
                                List a room, unit, or whole house in minutes. We handle
                                the visibility, the verification, and the paper trail —
                                you approve bookings and get paid. It costs nothing to list.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <a href="/become-a-host" class="ab-host-cta">
                            <i data-lucide="key-round" aria-hidden="true"></i> LIST YOUR SPACE
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="ab-close-cta ab-reveal" style="--d: .36s;">
                    <h3>Ready to find your place?</h3>
                    <p>
                        Browse verified listings across Dumaguete and Negros Oriental —
                        or say hello if you have a question we didn't cover.
                    </p>
                    <div class="ab-btn-row">
                        <a href="/listings" class="ab-btn ab-btn-primary">
                            <i data-lucide="search" aria-hidden="true"></i> BROWSE LISTINGS
                        </a>
                        <a href="/contacts" class="ab-btn ab-btn-outline">
                            <i data-lucide="headset" aria-hidden="true"></i> CONTACT US
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </section>

            </div>
        </main>

        {% include 'partials/footer.html.twig' %}

        {# Reduced-motion fallback for the CSS-gated reveal #}
        <script>
            (function () {
                var reduced = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
                if (reduced || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
                    document.querySelectorAll(".ab-reveal").forEach(function (el) {
                        el.classList.add("ab-in");
                    });
                }
            })();
        </script>

    </body>
</html>
